data: {"id": "443d75f3762e4759-thinking-parallel_evidence-1051", "run_id": "443d75f3762e4759", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **实体**：`aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` (UID: `3fce1c76-f1ba-4e68-8f05-a50d78a131c9`)。\n*   **状态**：Phase 为 `Running`，节点 `node2`。但 `Ready` 条件为 `False`，消息明确指出 `containers with unready status: [app]`。\n*   **重启记录**：容器 `app` 的 `restarts=0`。这意味着 Pod 启动后容器并未发生过崩溃重启。\n\n### 2. 支持 \"NotReady\" 异常的事实\n*   **指标层面**：Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_ready` 在窗口内值为 `0`，直接从监控侧证实了容器不处于就绪状态。\n*   **事件层面**：Kubelet 触发了高频 Warning 事件：`Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe f", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788463536696, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

